Value Filldown SLOT (.+CPU usage:)
Value Required FIVE_SEC (\d+)
Value ONE_MIN (\d+)
Value FIVE_MIN (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s*$$ -> Continue
  ^\s*${FIVE_SEC}%\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+seconds -> Continue
  ^\s*${ONE_MIN}%\s+in\s+last\s+1\s+minute -> Continue
  ^\s*${FIVE_MIN}%\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+minutes -> Record
  ^. -> Continue
